stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Uploaded

    Uploaded: Binary uploaded to bucket<br/>(e.g. chat-attachments, uid prefix)
    MetadataRow: assistant_attachments row created<br/>(bucket, path, mime, size)
    DescriptorPending: Awaiting descriptor<br/>BACKEND TODO FOR CODEX
    DescriptorReady: Descriptor uploaded to<br/>assistant-descriptors bucket<br/>BACKEND TODO FOR CODEX
    Queued: media_retention_queue row<br/>delete_after = created_at + 30m
    WaitingThreshold: Waiting for 30-minute threshold
    BinaryRemoved: Original object deleted,<br/>deleted_at stamped<br/>BACKEND TODO FOR CODEX
    DescriptorRetrieval: Later AI turns read descriptor<br/>instead of original binary<br/>BACKEND TODO FOR CODEX

    Uploaded --> MetadataRow
    MetadataRow --> DescriptorPending: assistant OUTPUT media only
    DescriptorPending --> DescriptorReady: descriptor generated + uploaded
    DescriptorReady --> Queued: descriptor_path set,<br/>status = descriptor_ready
    Queued --> WaitingThreshold
    WaitingThreshold --> BinaryRemoved: now() >= delete_after<br/>AND descriptor_path is not null
    BinaryRemoved --> DescriptorRetrieval

    MetadataRow --> [*]: ordinary user study uploads<br/>(user-materials, chat-attachments)<br/>NOT covered by this policy

    note right of WaitingThreshold
        Safety rule: no descriptor => the
        binary must not be deleted.
    end note
